# JalDrishti Frontend Environment Variables
# In local development: Leave empty to use the Vite proxy (:5501 -> :8000)
# In production (Vercel): Set this to your deployed FastAPI backend URL (e.g. on Render, Railway, Fly.io)
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://jaldrishti-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
